  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1715538998_796982_00286809cb0802727e045b3341caa8c4.jpg",
  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: center;\"><strong>Handmade wooden racetrack statues for motorsport and racing fans.</strong><br><br>✔ Handmade in Germany<br>✔ Crafted&nbsp;from sustainably sourced wood<br>✔&nbsp;3D layered design with&nbsp;detailed engravings<br>✔ Includes display stand and wall mounts<br>✔ Worldwide free shipping and returns<br><br>Experience the excitement of motorsport with our finely crafted wooden racetrack artworks. Our stunning 3D layered wooden statues brings the thrill of the track right into your home or office. Each layer is laser-cut from a selection of fine woods, chosen specifically to create a vivid contrast and a warm, inviting look.<br><br>The race tracks are brilliantly highlighted with an engraved racing stripe, making it stand out strikingly against the rich background. The roads are precision-cut from beech wood, while the base is made from walnut wood with detailed engravings that bring the circuits to life.<br><br>Whether you're decorating your space or looking for a unique gift, our racetrack statues are a perfect choice for any motorsport fan. Adorn your surroundings with a piece of racing heritage or gift someone a slice of the Formula 1 experience!<br><br>Questions or suggestions? We love to hear from you. Contact us anytime at contact@miniracetracks.com</p>\r\n</div>",
